{
  "name": "REDLINE — Car Spotting Dex",
  "short_name": "REDLINE",
  "description": "Spot a car in the wild, scan it, keep it as a card. An on-device vision model names it for you. 257 vehicles across six rarity tiers. Works offline and stores everything on your device.",
